{"id": "m54", "type": "版本", "question": "v2 生效后，A 团队之前按 v1 提交、还在验收期内的在途事项会被 v2 重新计算吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "f61d0fe2-3849-46ff-ace6-492b6b15fbeb", "elapsed_ms": 6611, "answer": "不会；v2 不自动追溯变更旧提交的约定，之前按 v1 提交的在途事项仍按提交日期适用 v1。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "在途期限按 v2 重算或缩短", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m55", "type": "版本", "question": "A 团队 2026-10-06 提交的交付，适用 v2.1 的 4 个工作日吗？现在该按几天？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "8d5394f4-3422-4f09-b073-7a4b3c8d7872", "elapsed_ms": 10081, "answer": "A 团队 2026-10-06 提交的交付不适用 v2.1 的 4 个工作日，因为 v2.1 已废止且效力回到 v2。 该提交自 2026-10-01 起适用当前 v2，应按 3 个工作日。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C3", "C4", "C5"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-P1-02", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-P1-01", "in_top5": false}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-P1-02", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-P1-01", "in_top20": false}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "按 4 个工作日给出现行期限", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m56", "type": "版本", "question": "交付规则 v3 草案把验收期缩短成了 2 个工作日，A 团队现在提交的能按 2 个工作日算吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "c9702951-ac9d-43d8-bab2-77da79b819d8", "elapsed_ms": 7235, "answer": "不能按 2 个工作日计算；A 团队现在提交的验收期限当前一律按 v2 的 3 个工作日。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2", "C3", "C4"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D3-01", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-08", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D3-01", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-08", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "把草案的 2 个工作日当作现行标准", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m57", "type": "版本", "question": "按现稿，v3 草案相对 v2 改了什么？草案生效前已在途的验收怎么办？", "outcome": "status:needs_clarification", "run_id": "c007bc36-4003-4e02-902c-9e48379f9dd7", "elapsed_ms": 67612, "answer": "证据仅显示 v3 草案涉及 2 个工作日的数值，且草案未生效、数值仍可能调整。 草案生效前已在途验收的适用版本取决于提交日期，需提交日期才能确定。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D3-05", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-D3-06", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-D3-07", "in_top5": false}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D3-05", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-D3-06", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-D3-07", "in_top20": false}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "把草案差异当作已生效变更", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m58", "type": "版本", "question": "v2.1 和 v2 现在是什么关系？引用 v2.1 的回答应该怎么处理？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "f1d8c405-bb0f-4a51-a934-6e631a24e11c", "elapsed_ms": 13363, "answer": "v2.1 已废止，撤回后效力回到 v2，v2 是当前规则。 引用 v2.1 的回答应视为过时或错误，不能把 v2.1 的 4 个工作日或提醒后 1 个工作日作为现行数值。 处理时应按提交日期适用版本：2026-10-01 起适用 v2，2026-09-01 至 09-30 适用 v1。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2", "C4"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-P1-07", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-09", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-P1-07", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-09", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "引用 v2.1 作为现行依据", "leaked": false}]}
